From: Arnon Kaufman <akaufman@habana.ai>
Date: Sat, 29 Jan 2022 01:03:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-65638] gaudi2: release: fix config link

Fix the link file name in one missed place

Change-Id: I532bfb255811811e58d715fec53de3f0a7067703
Signed-off-by: Arnon Kaufman <akaufman@habana.ai>
---

diff --git a/scripts/fwi/fw_installer.sh b/scripts/fwi/fw_installer.sh
index a739853..8287278 100755
--- a/scripts/fwi/fw_installer.sh
+++ b/scripts/fwi/fw_installer.sh
@@ -1412,7 +1412,7 @@
 		;;
 	NONE)
 		pinfo "--config-link [on|off]"
-		[[ -f ~/.hl_fwi.link ]] && {
+		[[ -f ~/.hl_fwi.cfg.link ]] && {
 			pinfo "config link: $(realpath ~/.hl_fwi.cfg.link)"
 		} || {
 			pinfo "Config link not exist"
